# AXIS Current Execution Pipeline

The current implemented execution pipeline is:

User
↓
Intent Engine
↓
Command Engine
↓
Planner
↓
Runtime
↓
Plugin Manager
↓
Plugin
↓
Response

Do not reorder these layers without an approved architecture decision.

# Architecture Evolution

AXIS contains two architectural views:

1. Current implementation architecture
- what exists today
- must be preserved

2. Future operating system architecture
- long-term vision
- guides future design

Do not implement future architecture prematurely.

Prefer incremental evolution.